{"version":1,"content":"<p>消息稱，美國警務部門擔心《GTA6》玩家可能把遊戲中的行為帶到現實，並以「警員不是NPC」作出提醒。發出這一提醒的是德克薩斯州弗洛雷斯維爾警察局，該部門在社交媒體上明確表示，他們所在的城市「不是洛聖都或罪惡都市的延伸」，並強調「我們的警員不是NPC」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587198.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.640794+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:41:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_hash":"a5e3db4ae9c86697d9312243eceef7df3a4c39f651797255018e2f890d345334","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}